 Anna Frank sono migliori amiche. Si perdono di vista, però, nel momento in cui nel 1942 la famiglia Frank è costretta a nascondersi per via delle sue origini ebree. Tre anni, le due ragazze si incontrano nel campo di concentramento di Bergen-Belsen. Qui, la coraggiosa Hannah metterà in pericolo la sua stessa vita nella speranza di essere d’aiuto ad Anna, ormai stremata…"},{"language":"en-US","title":"My Best Friend Anne Frank","overview":"Based on the real-life friendship between Anne Frank and Hannah Goslar, from Nazi-occupied Amsterdam to their harrowing reunion in a concentration camp."},{"language":"nl-NL","overview":"Hannah Goslar (1928) en Anne Frank (1929) zijn boezemvriendinnen in de tijd dat de Tweede Wereldoorlog uitbreekt. Wanneer de familie Frank onderduikt, verliezen ze elkaar uit het oog. Drie jaar later, in 1945, volgt een bijzondere ontmoeting tussen de twee meisjes in het concentratiekamp Bergen-Belsen. De moedige Hannah zet haar leven op het spel in de hoop haar sterk verzwakte vriendin te helpen."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uvLE01mupRdUe5YQq88doRBvrZS.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/giutn8OjG6WPQ7eqlk9PoJQyCae.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":788045,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"nl-NL","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uvLE01mupRdUe5YQq88doRBvrZS.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uvLE01mupRdUe5YQq88doRBvrZS.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uvLE01mupRdUe5YQq88doRBvrZS.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uvLE01mupRdUe5YQq88doRBvrZS.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6codIHEK